  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">在遊戲中新增可愛的可馴服老鼠，牠們會在需要時戰鬥並保護你。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">而且牠們很可愛。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預設情況下，牠們會生成在森林、沙漠和惡地生態域中。<br>（在 Forge 中，你可以透過編輯 data -&gt; biome tags 和 biome modifier 資料夾中的 json 檔案，或透過資源包來更改此設定和其他生成設定；在 Fabric 中則有對應的設定檔）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">有 10% 的機率會生成阿爾法老鼠。（體型更大、更強壯，但還是很可愛就是了……）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們有 8 種顏色變體。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">有時牠們會向你討食物。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以用任何食物物品來馴服或繁殖牠們。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果你給牠們腐肉，牠們的攻擊會讓目標中毒 15 秒。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">（此增益效果持續 15 分鐘）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">模組目前支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1094/199/logo.png\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><strong>若你需要 CurseForge 上不同版本的模組，請寄送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p>",
